    "sections": {
        "description": "WENS Barber is a modern and stylish WordPress theme crafted specifically for barber shops, hair salons, grooming studios, and men’s styling services. Featuring a clean and professional layout with an elegant dark color scheme, it delivers a bold, premium look that highlights your services, team, and portfolio beautifully. Built with full support for the WordPress block editor, WENS Barber allows easy customization without any coding knowledge. The theme is fully responsive, ensuring your website looks flawless on all devices and screen sizes. WENS Barber comes with dedicated sections for services, pricing, testimonials, team members, contact details, and appointment booking—helping you showcase your brand effectively and convert visitors into loyal clients. Optimized for speed and performance, this theme provides everything you need to build a professional, engaging, and high-converting website for your barber business."
    },
